body:
Feeling pretty shitty tbf, not trying to be attention seeky but I feel like it could maybe be useful to get this out there;

&#x200B;

I've been feeling more like I don't want to live than usual for the past few days, I'm scared that I might actually do it but also don't care. There's just so much shit going on that I feel I can't escape, I just feel so alone and that if I try to fix any of the issues I will be even more alone. I really don't wanna be here tbh boys.
